      "message": "I saw this but we have the exact same pattern 5 lines below in `MESSAGE_TIMEOUT_BIND`.\n\nSince no call and nothing is done beside assigning a value I didn\u0027t put a comment.\nThis is the kind of variable assignement that should go away with a proper refactor with a state machine (one day)",
